Dear Philip

For yr guidance to relay to vendor.
Usually, if a vendor gets agency of one Reefer Manufacturer.
He can also be agency for others too.....and quite often the same vendor is in most times agent for all vendors at most ports.

So, if a vendor is selected at BHBAH ports, he can turn up officially the vendor for all Major manufacturers (CARRIER, DAIKIN, STARCOOK, DAIKIN, THERMOKING).
Thus he will ultimately be handling all reefer containers, as carriers will officially like to choose the vendors who are official agent.

So, its in the best interest of the vendors at Bahrain to respond.

