<div>
<p style="word-break:break-all"><span lang="EN-SG" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Reference telecon, Port Authorities advised&nbsp;today&nbsp;morning that the above reefer&nbsp;is malfunctioning. We have arranged reefer&nbsp;technician&nbsp;on urgent basis&nbsp;who
