 view of this, controller is suspected to be malfunctioning)</span></span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue">Supply/Return at 1100hrs: -9.0C / -7.0C.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
