<div>
<p style="word-break:break-all"><span lang="EN-SG" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="word-break:break-all"><span lang="EN-SG" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">We have taken special approval from the customs&nbsp;and arranged to take out the&nbsp;malfunctioning export reefer container outside port&nbsp;to Shipper's cold
 store for de-stuffing the cargo.&nbsp;Also&nbsp;have arranged another empty reefer container for PTI and stuffing the cargo which has been de-stuffed to shipper's cold store.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="word-break:break-all"><span lang="EN-SG" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
